  - exists (4 * j + 17), (cden [] [] j BB1_1RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RD1LA_0RB___).
    split; [lia|]. split; [| exact (gbo_1RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RD1LA_0RB___ j)].
    rewrite (gso_1RB0LC_1LC1RB_0RD1LA_0RB___ p j E).
