Module LAPT_1RB0LC_1RC0RA_1LD1LC_0RB1RC.
(** * LAPT_1RB0LC_1RC0RA_1LD1LC_0RB1RC: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0LC_1RC0RA_1LD1LC_0RB1RC, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

