    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StD, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0LD_0LC0RA_1LA0LC_1RA1LA [SRotL 1; SWin 1; SCycL 2 0; SWin 1] (StD, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
