                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

Theorem nqhtr_1RB0LD_0LC0RA_1LA0LC_1RA1LA : NeverQuasiHaltsTr tm_1RB0LD_0LC0RA_1LA0LC_1RA1LA.
