    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StB, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0LD_0LC0RD_1LA1LC_0RB1RB [SCycL 4 0; SWin 4; SWinL 2] (StB, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
