    + exact run_ovf_1RB0LD_0LC1RA_0LD1LC_0RA1LD.
    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0LD_0LC1RA_0LD1LC_0RA1LD p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0LD_0LC1RA_0LD1LC_0RA1LD p j' E).
