    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0LD_0LC1RA_1LA1LC_0RA1LD [SCycL 2 0; SWin 3] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

